meta {
  name: Search by meaning
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=waiting
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Needs the embedder running (EMBEDDER_URL). `items` holds pieces with the word, `close` holds up to 5 pieces about the same thing without it (first line only, no marks, no matched line). No piece is in both. With the embedder stopped, `close` is [] and `items` still works. Signed in as the second writer, neither list may show the first writer's pieces.
}
